<title>AUSTRIA: LIBYA SAYS AGREEMENT TO BRING LOWER OPEC OUTPUT.</title>
<headline>LIBYA SAYS AGREEMENT TO BRING LOWER OPEC OUTPUT.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Libya's OPEC President Abdullah al-Badri said he expects OPEC output to fall as a result of an agreement reached on Wednesday to freeze quotas with a renewed commitment by members not to overproduce.</p>
<p>&quot;Production should go down,&quot; the minister told reporters.</p>
<p>-- Vienna newsroom +431 713 2002</p>
</text>
